; Build-time program that detects the platform-specific C++ compile/link flags
; for the desktop-integration stubs and writes them to sexp files consumed by
; ../dune. These stubs talk to Cocoa, GTK and Win32 directly and never include
; vendor/webview.h, so the flags here are deliberately narrower than the ones
; the core library needs: no WebKit, no WebKitGTK, no WebView2 SDK.
(executable
 (name discover)
 (libraries dune-configurator))
